{72}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{73}{A cryptozoologist is one who studies creatures too elusive to be caught or even have their very existence verified. In my case, I happen to be an expert on Gigantopithecus Arcanus, more commonly known as the Stillwater Giant.}{A cryptozoologist is one who studies creatures too elusive to be caught or even have their very existence verified. In my case, I happen to be an expert on Gigantopithecus Arcanus, more commonly known as the Stillwater Giant.}{}{}{}{ }
{74}{Too elusive? Isn't the Stillwater Giant a hoax?}{}{10}{}{83}{ }
{75}{The Stillwater Giant?}{}{5}{lf1 0}{93}{lf1 1 }
{77}{I've seen the pelt of the Stillwater Giant in a museum in Tarant.}{}{5}{gf1048 1, lf11 0}{153}{lf11 1 }
{81}{I thought it was someone who was too dim to be a real zoologist.}{}{8}{ch10}{83}{re -5 }
{82}{It is nice to meet you, but I must be on my way.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{83}{Most people cannot comprehend the diligence and patience required to study creatures of this type. They do not understand the long years it takes to gather authentic, verifiable evidence. But as you can see all around you, I have quite a collection of evidence.}{Most people cannot comprehend the diligence and patience required to study creatures of this type. They do not understand the long years it takes to gather authentic, verifiable evidence. But as you can see all around you, I have quite a collection of evidence.}{}{}{}{ }
{84}{What evidence?}{}{5}{}{123}{ }
{85}{I need to capture the Stillwater Giant.}{}{5}{qa1043 1}{133}{ }
{86}{What can you tell me about it?}{}{5}{}{93}{ }
{92}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{93}{The Stillwater Giant, Gigantopithecus Arcanus, is an extremely primitive species of giant thought to be extinct for over 25,000 years.  It was a rather strange offshoot of the Gigantopithecus genus.}{The Stillwater Giant, Gigantopithecus Arcanus, is an extremely primitive species of giant thought to be extinct for over 25,000 years.  It was a rather strange offshoot of the Gigantopithecus genus.}{}{}{}{lf1 1 }
{94}{Strange? In what way?}{}{5}{}{113}{ }
{96}{I've heard there is debate as to whether they ever existed at all.}{}{13}{}{163}{ }
{97}{I've seen the pelt of the Stillwater Giant in a museum in Tarant.}{}{5}{gf1048 1}{153}{ }
{103}{That is correct. I am the foremost authority on the Stillwater Giant. I have made tracking the beast my life's work.}{That is correct. I am the foremost authority on the Stillwater Giant. I have made tracking the beast my life's work.}{}{}{}{ }
{104}{What is it, actually?}{}{5}{}{93}{ }
{112}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{113}{Well, besides the fact that it was extremely hirsute for a giant, it had large horns. But the most fascinating aspect of the Gigantopithecus Arcanus was its ability to shape shift.}{Well, besides the fact that it was extremely hirsute for a giant, it had large horns. But the most fascinating aspect of the Gigantopithecus Arcanus was its ability to shape shift.}{}{}{}{lf2 1 }
{114}{I need to capture it.}{}{5}{qa 1043 1}{143}{ }
{115}{Hirsute? What does that mean?}{}{5}{lf12 0}{378}{lf12 1 }
{122}{Thank you for the information. I must be going.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{123}{I have gathered quite an extensive amount of fur samples, droppings, and full and partial footprint casts. Not to mention my numerous files of people who have actually seen the beast with their own eyes!}{I have gathered quite an extensive amount of fur samples, droppings, and full and partial footprint casts. Not to mention my numerous files of people who have actually seen the beast with their own eyes!}{}{}{}{ }
{124}{What can you tell me about it?}{}{5}{}{93}{ }
{133}{Capture it? Do you even know anything about it?}{Capture it? Do you even know anything about it?}{}{}{}{ }
{134}{Actually, no. What can you tell me about it?}{}{5}{}{93}{ }
{135}{Isn't it a primitive species of giant? What else is there to know?}{}{12}{}{113}{ }
{136}{All I need to know is how to catch it.}{}{5}{lf2 1}{143}{ }
{143}{Well then, it is fortuitous for both of us that you have sought me out. Most people feel that the capturing of the Stillwater Giant would be an impossibilty, but I have devised a way. I have tracked it to its lair, and I have been searching for a big game hunter to implement my plan.}{Well then, it is fortuitous for both of us that you have sought me out. Most people feel that the capturing of the Stillwater Giant would be an impossibilty, but I have devised a way. I have tracked it to its lair, and I have been searching for a big game hunter to implement my plan.}{}{}{}{ }
{144}{Why the need for a big game hunter? Couldn't you do it yourself?}{}{5}{}{173}{ }
{145}{Tell me what I need to do.}{}{5}{}{193}{ }
{153}{Yes, I have seen that as well. Quite amusing, actually. It is obviously fraudulent, sewn together from moth eaten old bear pelts with some fake antlers glued to its head for good measure.}{Yes, I have seen that as well. Quite amusing, actually. It is obviously fraudulent, sewn together from moth eaten old bear pelts with some fake antlers glued to its head for good measure.}{}{}{}{ }
{154}{I suspected as much. What can you tell me of the real Giant?}{}{5}{lf1 0, lf2 0}{93}{ }
{155}{I see. What is so unique about the Stillwater Giant?}{}{5}{lf1 1, lf2 0}{113}{ }
{156}{I've decided to hunt the real Stillwater Giant.}{}{5}{lf2 1}{143}{ }
{162}{Interesting. Well, I must take my leave.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{163}{Some of my more misinformed colleagues may still hold that position, but those at the forefront of this field of knowledge have no doubt that Gigantopithecus Arcanus is an authentic species. The debate now is whether there are any still alive.}{Some of my more misinformed colleagues may still hold that position, but those at the forefront of this field of knowledge have no doubt that Gigantopithecus Arcanus is an authentic species. The debate now is whether there are any still alive.}{}{}{}{ }
{164}{What makes it so unique from all the other giant species?}{}{5}{}{113}{ }
{173}{I wish that I had the qualities necessary to effect the beast's capture, but I am only a scientist. The Giant is a dangerous animal, and only the toughest and most experienced game hunters would even stand a chance against its fearsome attack.}{I wish that I had the qualities necessary to effect the beast's capture, but I am only a scientist. The Giant is a dangerous animal, and only the toughest and most experienced game hunters would even stand a chance against its fearsome attack.}{}{}{}{ }
{174}{I am afraid that rules me out. Can't we get someone else to do it?}{}{5}{}{183}{ }
{175}{Tell me what I need to do to capture it.}{}{5}{}{193}{ }
{176}{That sounds thrilling, but I must depart. Good day.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{183}{I have been searching for the proper individual to take on this task for some time now, but to no avail.}{I have been searching for the proper individual to take on this task for some time now, but to no avail.}{}{}{}{ }
{184}{Well, I suppose that leaves me with no choice. I'll do it.}{}{5}{}{193}{ }
{185}{I wish you luck on your search. Good day.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{193}{Excellent! I have constructed a special trap here, somewhere .... Ah! Here it is! Use this to trap the giant. [He hands you a small trap.]}{Excellent! I have constructed a special trap here, somewhere .... Ah! Here it is! Use this to trap the giant. [He hands you a small trap.]}{}{}{}{in -5609, lf6 1 }
{194}{This trap is ridiculously small. How can I catch a giant with this?}{}{5}{}{203}{ }
{203}{That is the beauty of the plan. We take advantage of the giant's unique shape shifting abilities. It takes an enormous amount of food to feed a creature of such enormous size, so it changes to a relatively small size to conserve its energy whenever it is in the safety of its lair.}{That is the beauty of the plan. We take advantage of the giant's unique shape shifting abilities. It takes an enormous amount of food to feed a creature of such enormous size, so it changes to a relatively small size to conserve its energy whenever it is in its lair.}{}{}{}{ }
{204}{So I just sneak up on it and use this trap on it? That sounds easy.}{}{5}{}{213}{ }
{205}{How will I know it's the creature if it is in its small state?}{}{5}{lf7 0}{223}{ }
{213}{It will be easy, as long as the creature is unaware of your presence. That is why an experienced hunter is needed for this task. For if it smells you, hears you, or even senses your presence, it will immediately shift to its full size and attack ferociously.}{It will be easy, as long as the creature is unaware of your presence. That is why an experienced hunter is needed for this task. For if it smells you, hears you, or even senses your presence, it will immediately shift to its full size and attack ferociously.}{}{}{}{ }
{214}{How am I suppose to get close enough to it to trap it, then?}{}{5}{lf4 0}{243}{ }
{215}{How will I know it's the creature if it is in its small state?}{}{5}{lf7 0}{223}{ }
{222}{This is all so overwhelming. I must think on it further. Good day.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{223}{It bears a strong resemblance to a rabbit, of all things! Its only distinguishing characteristic to differentiate it from your run of the mill rabbit is that it is blue in color.}{It bears a strong resemblance to a rabbit, of all things! Its only distinguishing characteristic to differentiate it from your run of the mill rabbit is that it is blue in color.}{}{}{}{lf7 1, gf1091 1 }
{224}{A rabbit? You must be joking! This is a joke, right?}{}{5}{}{233}{ }
{225}{How can I get close enough to trap it without startling it?}{}{5}{lf4 0}{243}{ }
{226}{What will keep it from changing to its full size after it's captured?}{}{5}{lf4 0}{271}{ }
{227}{I already killed it, but it didn't transform into the giant.}{}{5}{gf2352 1}{415}{ }
{232}{This is all so overwhelming. I must think on it further. Good day.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{233}{It is no joke, and you should not treat it as such. Besides conservation of energy, its small state is also used to lure in unsuspecting prey, as the giant is not the quickest of creatures in its large form. So if you startle it, I suggest you run, as it is likely that you can outrun it.}{It is no joke, and you should not treat it as such. Besides conservation of energy, its small state is also used to lure in unsuspecting prey, as the giant is not the quickest of creatures in its large form. So if you startle it, I suggest you run, as it is likely that you can outrun it.}{}{}{}{ }
{234}{How can I get close enough to trap it without startling it?}{}{5}{lf4 0}{243}{ }
{235}{Where do I go to find it?}{}{5}{lf4 1}{263}{ }
{236}{What will keep it from changing to its full size after it's captured?}{}{5}{lf4 0}{271}{ }
{243}{Here is a scent that you can use to mask your smell from it. I suggest you take off any armor you are wearing and use this before approaching. You will be more silent without armor, and if you do startle it, there is a slight chance it will not see you as a threat.}{Here is a scent that you can use to mask your smell from it. I suggest you take off any armor you are wearing and use this before approaching. You will be more silent without armor, and if you do startle it, there is a slight chance it will not see you as a threat.}{}{}{}{in -3610, lf4 1, ru2028 }
{244}{Where do I go to find it?}{}{5}{lf7 1}{263}{ }
{245}{I'm not stripping down to face this monster with no armor.}{}{5}{}{253}{ }
{246}{How will I know it's the creature if it is in its small state?}{}{5}{lf7 0}{223}{ }
{253}{Then you will most likely die. If you intend to fight the giant face to face, I commend you on your courage, though I can not say the same about your intelligence.}{Then you will most likely die. If you intend to fight the giant face to face, I commend you on your courage, though I can not say the same about your intelligence.}{}{}{}{ }
{254}{Where do I go to find it?}{}{5}{}{263}{ }
{255}{This sounds like suicide. I will have to decline. Good day.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{263}{Ahhh that is the easy part of your task. I have built this house as near to its lair as I dare. Simply take the path behind out back until it ends at a cave entrance. The giant resides somewhere deep in the labyrinth of tunnels within.}{Ahhh that is the easy part of your task. I have built this house as near to its lair as I dare. Simply take the path behind out back until it ends at a cave entrance. The giant resides somewhere deep in the labyrinth of tunnels within.}{}{}{}{lf5 1 }
