{276}{This is it. We simply need the authentication of the scientific establishment in Tarant to legitimize it. We couldn't even hope to publish our findings without their backing. Bring it to Dr. Tristan Fenwick of the Tarant zoological society, he is a genius. I'm sure he will help us.}{This is it. We simply need the authentication of the scientific establishment in Tarant to legitimize it. We couldn't even hope to publish our findings without their backing. Bring it to Dr. Tristan Fenwick of the Tarant zoological society, he is a genius. I'm sure he will help us.}{}{}{}{lf8 1, gf2125 1, ru2029 }
