{278}{I'm off to see Dr. Fenwick, then.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{281}{Are you insane? That thing would tear us both limb from limb as soon as we were to release it! Bring it to Dr. Fenwick, he will find a suitable habitat where we can watch its transformation from a safe distance.}{Are you insane? That thing would tear us both limb from limb as soon as we were to release it! Bring it to Dr. Fenwick, he will find a suitable habitat where we can watch its transformation from a safe distance.}{}{}{}{ }
{282}{I'm off to see Dr. Fenwick, then.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{286}{I am assuming your associate is not a zoologist. There are several subtle features that show us that this is the giant, and not a rabbit. For instance, its head is much longer and narrower than a real rabbit, its pelt is blue, and it is much heavier than it should be.}{I am assuming your associate is not a zoologist. There are several subtle features that show us that this is the giant, and not a rabbit. For instance, its head is much longer and narrower than a real rabbit, its pelt is blue, and it is much heavier than it should be.}{}{}{}{ }
{287}{I believe you are playing me for a fool, sir.}{}{5}{}{291}{ }
{288}{So you are saying this is it?}{}{5}{lf8 0}{276}{ }
{291}{Believe what you will, I am speaking the truth. Dr. Fenwick will also verify that this is the creature, and not a simple rabbit.}{Believe what you will, I am speaking the truth. Dr. Fenwick will also verify that this is the creature, and not a simple rabbit.}{}{}{}{ }
{292}{Dr. Fenwick?}{}{5}{lf8 0}{296}{ }
