{296}{Dr. Tristan Fenwick of the Tarant zoological society, he is a genius. I'm sure he will help us. We  need the authentication of the scientific establishment in Tarant to legitimize our claim. Without their backing we wouldn't have any hope of publishing our findings.}{Dr. Tristan Fenwick of the Tarant zoological society, he is a genius. I'm sure he will help us. We  need the authentication of the scientific establishment in Tarant to legitimize our claim. Without their backing we wouldn't have any hope of publishing our findings.}{}{}{}{lf8 1, gf2125 1 }
